    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ToneTrek</strong> is a colorful and clever logic puzzle game where every step reshapes the board.<br>Your mission: walk across a grid of tiles, change their colors in a looping sequence, and recreate a target pattern \u2014 all in as few moves as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With minimalist visuals, relaxing sound design, and gameplay that ranges from chill to brain-bending, <i>ToneTrek</i> is perfect for puzzle fans who enjoy planning, experimenting, and finding the most efficient path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing a quick level or diving into the full campaign, every puzzle is handcrafted to challenge your logic and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851630/extras/fbb5bb69a7f82fe66ad8373a865bbf69.avif?t=1754648828\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Grid-Based Logic Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Each step cycles a tile\u2019s color; plan your route carefully to match the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Campaign, single-level, move limit, time limit, and free play options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customizable Visuals</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of color palettes and tile styles to suit your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Score Attack</strong> \u2013 Beat your own move/time records and unlock harder challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multilingual Support</strong> \u2013 English, Espa\u00f1ol, Deutsch, and Magyar at launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>42+ Handcrafted Levels</strong> \u2013 From simple geometric patterns to complex pixel-art shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Replay-Friendly Design</strong> \u2013 Try different strategies, improve your path, or just relax and color your way through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd98 <strong>Built-In Tutorial</strong> \u2013 Learn the rules step by step with accessible onboarding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ToneTrek is simple to pick up but offers deep satisfaction for players who enjoy puzzles that reward clever thinking and precision planning.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ToneTrek</strong> is a colorful and clever logic puzzle game where every step reshapes the board.<br>Your mission: walk across a grid of tiles, change their colors in a looping sequence, and recreate a target pattern \u2014 all in as few moves as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With minimalist visuals, relaxing sound design, and gameplay that ranges from chill to brain-bending, <i>ToneTrek</i> is perfect for puzzle fans who enjoy planning, experimenting, and finding the most efficient path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing a quick level or diving into the full campaign, every puzzle is handcrafted to challenge your logic and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851630/extras/fbb5bb69a7f82fe66ad8373a865bbf69.avif?t=1754648828\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Grid-Based Logic Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Each step cycles a tile\u2019s color; plan your route carefully to match the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Campaign, single-level, move limit, time limit, and free play options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customizable Visuals</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of color palettes and tile styles to suit your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Score Attack</strong> \u2013 Beat your own move/time records and unlock harder challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multilingual Support</strong> \u2013 English, Espa\u00f1ol, Deutsch, and Magyar at launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>42+ Handcrafted Levels</strong> \u2013 From simple geometric patterns to complex pixel-art shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Replay-Friendly Design</strong> \u2013 Try different strategies, improve your path, or just relax and color your way through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd98 <strong>Built-In Tutorial</strong> \u2013 Learn the rules step by step with accessible onboarding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ToneTrek is simple to pick up but offers deep satisfaction for players who enjoy puzzles that reward clever thinking and precision planning.</i></p>",
